{title: 471 - Grant Us Your Peace}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #471 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 471}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Dona [Dm]nobis [C]pacem, [Dm]pacem; Dona [F/C]nobis [C7/Bb]pacem.
[C]Dona [C7]nobis pacem; [C]Dona [C7/Bb]nobis [Am]pacem.
[F/C]Dona nobis [C7]pacem; [Gm/D]Dona [F/C]nobis [Am]pacem.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Father [F/C]grant [C]us, [Dm]grant [C]us [C7/Bb]Your peace;
[C]Oh, loving Father, [Dm]grant [C]us [C7/Bb]Your [F/A]peace.
[C]Grant [C7]us, [Dm]grant [C]us [Am]peace;
[C]Grant [C7]us, grant [Dm]us, [C]grant [C7/Bb]Your peace;
[F/C]Grant us, [C7]grant [F/C]us [C7/Bb]peace;
[F/C]Loving [C7]Father, [Gm/D]grant [F/C]us [C7/Bb]Your [Am]peace.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Accordenous ta paix, [Dm]ta paix, Accordenous [C7/Bb]ta [C]paix.
[C]Accordenous [C7]ta [Dm]paix; [C]Accordenous [Am]ta [C7/Bb]paix.
[F/C]Accordenous [C7]ta paix, [Gm/D]Accordenous [Am]ta [C7/Bb]paix.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Padre, danos [Dm]tupaz, [C]tupaz; [Dm]Padre, danos, [F/C]danos [C7/Bb]tupaz
[C]Padre, [C7]danos, tupaz. [Dm]Padre, [C]danos, [C7/Bb]danos [Am]tupaz
[F/C]Padre, [Dm]danos [C7]tupaz. Padre, [Gm/D]danos, [F/C]danos [Am]tupaz.
{end_of_verse}
